OL,3,GOPINIONCHas Burnham poured cold water
OL,4,Con 2034 Freeview switch-off plan?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIs the prospect of Freeview being
OL,7,Fswitched off in 2034 receding?
OL,9,FLike any new Prime Minister, it is easy
OL,10,Ffor Andy Burnham to secure easy
OL,11,Fheadlines from bland statements.
OL,13,F"I'll look at this" or "I can see why
OL,14,Fpeople are concerned" are not policy
OL,15,Fcommitments.
OL,17,FBut I was struck recently when Mr
OL,18,FBurnham said he was worried by moves to
OL,19,Fswitch off terrestrial TV in 2034.
OL,23,EPub: 20-Sep-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
