OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1789911686
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCHas Burnham poured cold water
OL,4,Con 2034 Freeview switch-off plan?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt sets the mood music ` for
OL,7,Fbroadcasters, politicians and civil
OL,8,Fservants.
OL,10,FIf nothing else, there will need to be
OL,11,Fa clear indication of the numbers which
OL,12,Fwill have to be reached before a switch
OL,13,Foff is feasible.
OL,15,FMeanwhile a surprising move last week
OL,16,Fshowed that improvements to Freeview
OL,17,Fare still possible.
OL,19,FFour extra channels were added to the
OL,20,FD3/4 multiplex by using a more
OL,21,Fefficient encoding system.
OL,23,EPub: 20-Sep-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14103
