PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1789911686
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCHas Burnham poured cold water
OL,4,Con 2034 Freeview switch-off plan?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis means ITV 2 + 1, ITV 4 + 1, E4
OL,7,FExtra and Film4 + 1 are now on Freeview
OL,8,FLight.
OL,10,FIt means Channel 4 is no longer having
OL,11,Fto buy slots on commercial multiplexes.
OL,13,FITV is now able to make far better use
OL,14,Fof its gifted capacity.
OL,16,FSome older sets and boxes may not be
OL,17,Fable to receive the extra channels.
OL,19,FBut could more channels move to the
OL,20,Fmore efficient encoding system?
OL,23,EPub: 20-Sep-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
